{"id":"proekhat_","lemma":"проехать","pos":"verb","rank":2951,"glosses":["to go through/by (by horse or vehicle), to ride through/by, to drive through/by","to drive past/along/across","to travel (a certain distance)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5b/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"проеду","2s":"проедешь","3s":"проедет","1p":"проедем","2p":"проедете","3p":"проедут"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"проезжай","2p":"проезжайте"}}},"past":{"m":"проехал","p":"проехали","f":"проехала","n":"проехало"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"проезжать","examples":[{"text":"Можно проехать туда на машине?","en":"Can you get there by car?","words":[{"g":"one can, one may"},null,{"g":"there"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Проехала машина.","en":"A car went by.","words":[null,{"g":"car, motor vehicle"}]},{"text":"Я хочу проехать как можно дальше.","en":"I want to go as far as I can.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,null,null,{"g":"furthermore"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"it is impossible!"]]},{"text":"Я проехал на красный свет.","en":"I ran a red light.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"on / at"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"red light"]]},{"text":"Ты на красный проехала.","en":"You ran a red light.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"red"},null]}]}